    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=6c9CieCQWV7XsKLy]], one creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=6c9CieCQWV7XsKLy]] feet. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Stunned apply=false] condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After [[lookup @duration.value activity=6c9CieCQWV7XsKLy]] minute, it succeeds automatically.</p>",
